{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Tank - A tank auto-battle game where you battle eight beautiful female generals with tanks. After victory, another battle awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an auto-battle tank game where players simply dispatch their tanks to defeat the female generals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game has three levels, and players can directly challenge the highest difficulty to unlock all the content for a female general. (It is recommended to play through levels 1 and 2 once first. Once all tanks are unlocked, play level 3.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the gallery, press &quot;A&quot;, &quot;D&quot;, or the left and right arrow keys to navigate to the previous or next image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse wheel to zoom in and out, and hold down the mouse to drag the image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Image size is 960x1088 px.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024540?t=1758085982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024540?t=1758085982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024540/1b44d208831986195e95374ca6f9305a46f0e107/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758085982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024540/1b44d208831986195e95374ca6f9305a46f0e107/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758085982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"- Nudity or pornographic content\r\n- Contains female masturbation content\r\n- Clear depiction of male/female reproductive organs\r\n- Not suitable for viewing at work\r\n- Not suitable for all ages\r\n- All characters in the game are over 18 years old"},"detailed_description":"<p class=